{"strongs": "H7194", "word": "קָשַׁר", "translit": "qa.shar", "root": "קשט", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "bind, league together, conspire", "definition": "קָשַׁר verb bind, league together, conspire (Late Hebrew id., bind, join , קֶשֶׁר knot ; ᵑ7 קְטַר , Syriac bind ( ט for ת after ק ) Nö ZMG xi.735 , who compare also ('perhaps') Arabic force to do a thing, Ethiopic bind ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular קָשַׁר Amos 7:10 ; 1Kgs 16:16 2 masculine singular suffix וּקְשַׁרְתָּם consecutive Deut 6:8 , etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיִּקְשֹׁר 1Kgs 15:27 +, וַיִּקְשָׁרֿ 2Kgs 15:30 , etc.; Imperative masculine singular suffix קָשְׁרֵם Prov 3:3 +; Participle active plural קשְׁרִים 2Sam 15:31 +; passive feminine singular קְשׁוּרָה Gen 44:30 ; Prov 22:15 plural קְשֻׁרִים Gen 30:42 — 1. bind: \\ \\ a. literal, with accusative of thing + עַל Gen 38:28 ( J ), Jer 51:63 , + ב , Josh 2:18 ; Josh 2:21 ( J E ); bind, confine , with accusative רֵים Job 39:10 (+ בְּתֶלֶם ), accusative of crocodile Job 40:29 . \\ \\ b. figurative, with accusative + עַל Deut 6:8 ; Deut 11:18 ; Prov 3:3 ; Prov 6:21 ; Prov 7:3 (all of religious and moral precepts); with ב , נַפְשׁוֺ קְשׁוּרָה בְנַפְשׁוֺ Gen 44:30 his life is bound up with his [namely the boy's] life ( J ; of strong affection); בְלֶבנָֿ֑עַר ׳ אִוֶּלֶת ק Prov 22:15 . \\ \\ c. passive participle vigorous (properly well- knit ; opposed to עֲטֻפִים ) Gen 30:42 ( J ). 2. league together, conspire: with עָ person against 1Sam 22:8 ; 1Sam 22:13 ; 1Sam 1:27 ; 1Sam 16:9 ; 1Sam 2:9 ; 1Sam 15:10 ; 2Kgs 21:24 = 2Chr 33:24 ; 2Chr 33:25 ; 2Chr 24:21 with accusative of congnate meaning with verb קֶשֶׁר , 1Kgs 16:20 ; 2Kgs 12:21 ; 2Kgs 15:15 , + עַל person 2Kgs 14:19 = 2Chr 25:27 ; 2Kgs 15:30 absolute 1Kgs 16:16 ; Neh 4:2 (+ infinitive purpose); with עִם , together with, 2Sam 15:31 . Niph`al Perfect 3 feminine singular נִקְשְׁרָה 1Sam 18:1 the life of Jonathan was bound up with the life of David ( Qal 1 b ); Imperfect 3 feminine singular וַתִּקָּשֵׁר כָּלהַֿחוֺמָה Neh 3:38 all the wall was joined together (the circuit complete). Pi`el Imperfect 1. bind on (as ornament), 2 feminine singular suffix וּתְקַשְּׁרִים Isa 49:18 (figurative; || תִּלְבְּשִׁי ). 2. bind fast , 2 masculine singular תְקַשּׁר ( הַ ) מַעֲדַנּוֺת כִּימָה Job 38:31 canst thou bind fast the bands of the Pleiades ? Pu`al Participle הַצּאִן הַמְּקֻשָּׁרוֺת Gen 30:41 ( J ), = Qal 1 with Hithpa`el conspire: Perfect 3 plural הִתְקַשְּׁרוּ עַלֿ 2Chr 24:25 (|| 2Kgs 12:21 Qal 2 ); Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיִּתְקַשּׁר אֶלֿ 2Kgs 9:14 Participle plural הַמִּתְקַשְּׁרִים עָלָיו 2Chr 24:26 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7646')\">BDB7646</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7194')\">H7194</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7645')\">BDB7645</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7647')\">BDB7647</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קָשַׁר</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>bind, league together, conspire</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id., bind, join</highlight>, <bdbheb>קֶשֶׁר</bdbheb> <highlight>knot</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>קְטַר</bdbheb>, Syriac <placeholder4899/> <highlight>bind</highlight> (<bdbheb>ט</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> after <bdbheb>ק</bdbheb>) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö<sup>ZMG xi.735</sup></lookup>, who compare also ('perhaps') Arabic <placeholder4900/> <highlight>force</highlight> to do a thing, Ethiopic <placeholder4901/> <highlight>bind</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>קָשַׁר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 7:10\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,10)\">Amos 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:16\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,16)\">1Kgs 16:16</ref> 2 masculine singular suffix <bdbheb>וּקְשַׁרְתָּם</bdbheb>