v(6,2,18)\">Josh 2:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 2:21\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(6,2,21)\">Josh 2:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); <highlight>bind, confine</highlight>, with accusative <bdbheb>רֵים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 39:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,39,10)\">Job 39:10</ref> (+ <bdbheb>בְּתֶלֶם</bdbheb>), accusative of crocodile <ref ref=\"Job 40:29\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,29)\">Job 40:29</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> figurative, with accusative + <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 6:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,8)\">Deut 6:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 11:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,18)\">Deut 11:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 3:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,3)\">Prov 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 6:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,21)\">Prov 6:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 7:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,3)\">Prov 7:3</ref> (all of religious and moral precepts); with <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נַפְשׁוֺ קְשׁוּרָה בְנַפְשׁוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 44:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,30)\">Gen 44:30</ref> <highlight>his life is bound up with his</highlight> [namely the boy's] <highlight>life</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; of strong affection); <bdbheb>בְלֶבנָֿ֑עַר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אִוֶּלֶת ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 22:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,22,15)\">Prov 22:15</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b